d0g|n|Partly burned or vitrified coal, or other combustible, in which fire is extinct. ; A hot coal without flame; an ember. ; A scale thrown off in forging metal. ; The slag of a furnace, or scoriaceous lava from a volcano.	N:8dn,114,2;8d8,91,3~8d8,91,3;8dn,114,2
